    "sections": {
        "description": "Business Database Agency provides a clean and organised website structure with flexible customization options and configurable content sections. It includes homepage areas for featured content, testimonials, service information, team profiles, contact details, and image galleries. Users can modify typography, colours, navigation menus, widget areas, headers, footers, and logo settings through the built-in Customizer without changing the core files. These settings help maintain a consistent design across the website. The theme supports the block editor and works with commonly used page builders for creating customised page layouts. It also offers compatibility with plugins for contact forms, SEO, caching, and security to extend functionality when required. Translation-ready support makes multilingual content easier to manage, while standard coding practices help maintain compatibility with ongoing platform updates. Additional customization options allow adjustments to spacing, page structure, banners, widgets, and content placement. Business Database Agency provides organised layout controls, footer settings, image management options, and configurable homepage sections that simplify website updates while maintaining a clear and structured presentation throughout the site."
    },
